      "id": "claim_41380c0a61674445b2e9a1c0d5eb25bb",
      "statement": "scripts/bootstrap-apps.sh runs an ordered, idempotent bootstrap: check_env/check_cli guards → wait for all nodes Ready=False → apply one namespace per kubernetes/apps/* dir → decrypt and server-side apply three SOPS secrets (github-deploy-key, cluster-secrets, sops-age) into flux-system → apply external-dns and gateway-api CRDs → `helmfile sync bootstrap/helmfile.yaml`; the log error helper exits 1 so failures abort the script.",
